<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<roster id="j0b78dv" name="obr-001-all-units" battleScribeVersion="2.03" generatedBy="https://newrecruit.eu" gameSystemId="e51d-b1a3-75fc-dc3g" gameSystemName="Age of Sigmar 4.0" gameSystemRevision="98" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/rosterSchema"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="5610" /></costs><costLimits><costLimit name="pts" typeId="points" value="0" /></costLimits><forces><force id="jexwzk" name="✦ General's Handbook 2026-27" entryId="0151-9c5b-2f1e-32d4" catalogueId="8e0e-5e8c-5824-89c9" catalogueRevision="36" catalogueName="Ossiarch Bonereapers"><selections><selection id="rxquj0vg" name="Allow Legends" entryId="7e59-2237-4890-a80a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="676-2b78-7bbf-ba9c" entryId="676-2b78-7bbf-ba9c" name="Configuration" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="satauxl" name="Battle Traits: Ossiarch Bonereapers" entryId="830c-f01c-804d-96d4::bc5f-6169-d1c-e4af" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="ff4e-8de5-35f5-5a29" name="Immortal Elite" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle Round (Army), Start of Battle Round</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">You must use this ability if there are any **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers Heroes^^** on the battlefield. Pick a friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers Hero^^** to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">You gain a number of **relentless discipline** points equal to the number after the target's **^^Relentless Discipline^^** keyword. At the end of the battle round, any unspent **relentless discipline** points are lost.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Relentless Discipline^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="a676-243e-ce91-fbcf" name="Impassive Retreat" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Movement Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** unit that has not used a **^^Relentless Discipline^^** ability this phase to use this ability.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Spend 1 **relentless discipline** point. If that unit is reinforced and has more than half of its starting models, spend 2 **relentless discipline** points instead. For the rest of the turn, that unit can use **^^Charge^^** abilities even if it used a **^^Retreat^^** ability in the same turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Relentless Discipline^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="b0bd-96e3-ff9e-46a0" name="Ruthless Extermination" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Reaction: You declared a **^^Shoot^^** ability for a unit that has not used a **^^Relentless Discipline^^** ability this phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Spend 1 **relentless discipline** point. If that unit is reinforced and has more than half of its starting models, spend 2 **relentless discipline** points instead. Subtract 1 from ward rolls for damage points inflicted by attacks made as part of that **^^Shoot^^** ability.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Relentless Discipline^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b">The unit using that **^^Shoot^^** ability.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Blue</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Shooting</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="d313-7858-8093-a6a0" name="Pitiless Assault" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Reaction: You declared a **^^Fight^^** ability for a unit that has not used a **^^Relentless Discipline^^** ability this phase.</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Spend 1 **relentless discipline** point. If that unit is reinforced and has more than half of its starting models, spend 2 **relentless discipline** points instead. Add 1 to wound rolls for attacks made as part of that **^^Fight^^** ability.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Relentless Discipline^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b">The unit using that **^^Fight^^** ability.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="d7c-9c10-b15d-e67c" name="Remorseless March" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Movement Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** unit that has not used a **^^Relentless Discipline^^** ability this phase to use this ability.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Spend 1 **relentless discipline** point. If that unit is reinforced and has more than half of its starting models, spend 2 **relentless discipline** points instead. Add 3&quot; to the Move characteristic of that unit for the rest of the phase. That unit cannot use **^^run^^** abilities for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Relentless Discipline^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="e274-c75d-abf2-df6d" name="Inviolate Legions" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Reaction: Opponent declared an **^^Attack^^** ability.</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Spend 1 **relentless discipline** point. If that unit is reinforced and has more than half of its starting models, spend 2 **relentless discipline** points instead. That unit has **^^Ward (5+)^^** against damage points inflicted by attacks made as part of that **^^Attack^^** ability.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Relentless Discipline^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b">A friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** unit targeted by that **^^Attack^^** ability. Friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** units can use this ability more than once per phase.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Green</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile></profiles><categories><category id="3360-1158-e879-9606" entryId="3360-1158-e879-9606" name="Reference" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="kafh3dm" name="Battle Formation" entryId="e803-e316-2598-3501" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="slp9hni" name="Battle Formation" entryId="e803-e316-2598-3501" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="kdr6pv" name="Battle Tactic Cards" entryId="1668-6989-2470-5e10" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="sujjydb" name="Battle Tactic Cards" entryId="1668-6989-2470-5e10" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="kf3dbv" name="Manifestation Lore" entryId="91d-5346-9479-8caa" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="t0vmyr" name="Manifestation Lore" entryId="91d-5346-9479-8caa" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="kh5932j" name="Spell Lore" entryId="1c11-e9eb-cbcd-a210" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><selections><selection id="kie964" name="Lore of Ossian Sorcery" entryId="e934-fd22-9567-6284::9f4d-92cc-3baa-ce61" entryGroupId="e934-fd22-9567-6284::5203-8581-edbd-55bb" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Spell Lores"><selections><selection id="kjchug" name="Drain Vitality" entryId="e934-fd22-9567-6284::403d-0647-a65d-d51c::282f-dc47-e653-a3f7" entryGroupId="e934-fd22-9567-6284::403d-0647-a65d-d51c::8f74-7e87-b959-8b07" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of Ossian Sorcery"><profiles><profile id="af24-69cd-25ee-f2df" name="Drain Vitality" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn, subtract 1 from hit rolls for the target's attacks and subtract 1 from save rolls for the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031" /></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="kj0alwh" name="Empower Nadirite Weapons" entryId="e934-fd22-9567-6284::403d-0647-a65d-d51c::66fb-b286-fea5-6ded" entryGroupId="e934-fd22-9567-6284::403d-0647-a65d-d51c::8f74-7e87-b959-8b07" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of Ossian Sorcery"><profiles><profile id="a532-2fb6-7eae-b011" name="Empower Nadirite Weapons" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">The target's melee weapons have **Crit (2 Hits)** until the start of your next turn. If all of the target's non-**Companion** melee weapons had **Crit (2 Hits)** when they were picked to be the target of this ability, the target's combat attacks score critical hits on unmodified hit rolls of 5+ until the start of your next turn instead.


Friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** units can be affected by this ability multiple times.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**, **^^Unlimited^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Offensive</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="kjwzum" name="Immolating Flames" entryId="e934-fd22-9567-6284::403d-0647-a65d-d51c::7fc2-08f6-c71e-742f" entryGroupId="e934-fd22-9567-6284::403d-0647-a65d-d51c::8f74-7e87-b959-8b07" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of Ossian Sorcery"><profiles><profile id="50b0-fc22-4be6-ceed" name="Immolating Flames" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn, each time a model in the target unit is slain by a combat attack and that model was in combat with the attacking unit, roll a number of dice equal to the target's Health characteristic. For each 5+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the attacking unit after the **^^Fight^^** ability has been resolved.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Offensive</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="t68gsy" name="Spell Lore" entryId="1c11-e9eb-cbcd-a210" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><selections><selection id="t7xonwo" name="Lore of Ossian Sorcery" entryId="e934-fd22-9567-6284::9f4d-92cc-3baa-ce61" entryGroupId="e934-fd22-9567-6284::5203-8581-edbd-55bb" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Spell Lores"><selections><selection id="t8kzctb" name="Drain Vitality" entryId="e934-fd22-9567-6284::403d-0647-a65d-d51c::282f-dc47-e653-a3f7" entryGroupId="e934-fd22-9567-6284::403d-0647-a65d-d51c::8f74-7e87-b959-8b07" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of Ossian Sorcery"><profiles><profile id="af24-69cd-25ee-f2df" name="Drain Vitality" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn, subtract 1 from hit rolls for the target's attacks and subtract 1 from save rolls for the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031" /></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="t8t7bin" name="Empower Nadirite Weapons" entryId="e934-fd22-9567-6284::403d-0647-a65d-d51c::66fb-b286-fea5-6ded" entryGroupId="e934-fd22-9567-6284::403d-0647-a65d-d51c::8f74-7e87-b959-8b07" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of Ossian Sorcery"><profiles><profile id="a532-2fb6-7eae-b011" name="Empower Nadirite Weapons" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">The target's melee weapons have **Crit (2 Hits)** until the start of your next turn. If all of the target's non-**Companion** melee weapons had **Crit (2 Hits)** when they were picked to be the target of this ability, the target's combat attacks score critical hits on unmodified hit rolls of 5+ until the start of your next turn instead.


Friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** units can be affected by this ability multiple times.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**, **^^Unlimited^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Offensive</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="t84gzzd" name="Immolating Flames" entryId="e934-fd22-9567-6284::403d-0647-a65d-d51c::7fc2-08f6-c71e-742f" entryGroupId="e934-fd22-9567-6284::403d-0647-a65d-d51c::8f74-7e87-b959-8b07" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of Ossian Sorcery"><profiles><profile id="50b0-fc22-4be6-ceed" name="Immolating Flames" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn, each time a model in the target unit is slain by a combat attack and that model was in combat with the attacking unit, roll a number of dice equal to the target's Health characteristic. For each 5+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the attacking unit after the **^^Fight^^** ability has been resolved.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Offensive</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="tkf2g" name="Bone-tithe Nexus" entryId="5ebd-68b8-54d8-f7b1::d520-813-31df-e5a1" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><rules><rule id="65a-85b3-40b6-e16c" name="Bone-tithe Nexus" hidden="false"><description>**The following universal terrain abilities apply to this terrain feature (Terrain, 1.2):
Cover, Unstable**</description></rule></rules><profiles><profile id="12b7-ab68-ac10-6ca3" name="Deathly Aura" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Enemy units cannot be set up within **X**&quot; Of this terrain feature, where **X** is determined by the current battle round, as follows:
1    9&quot;
2    12&quot;
3    15&quot;
4    18&quot;
5    21&quot;</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="6d63-8a94-1a1b-f11a" name="Bone-tithe Nexus" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">13</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="tkjmvyk" name="Almighty Obsidian Blade" entryId="5ebd-68b8-54d8-f7b1::b00c-9d47-1f72-e6b6" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="c595-d6d1-2f8f-940f" name="Almighty Obsidian Blade" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections><categories><category id="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" name="DEATH" entryId="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" primary="false" /><category id="5603-d1-a021-331e" name="OSSIARCH BONEREAPERS" entryId="5603-d1-a021-331e" primary="false" /><category id="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" entryId="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" name="FACTION TERRAIN" primary="true" /></categories></selection></selections><costs><cost name="Force Category - GHB" typeId="de92-2099-fbf7-a156" value="1" /></costs><categories><category name="Configuration" id="aipauk" primary="false" entryId="676-2b78-7bbf-ba9c" /><category name="Reference" id="aickqi9" primary="false" entryId="3360-1158-e879-9606" /><category name="Army Composition" id="jhs1mf" primary="false" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" /><category name="FACTION TERRAIN" id="ajgjdu" primary="false" entryId="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" /><category name="Illegal Units" id="7pi3f1o" primary="false" entryId="(Illegal Units)" /></categories><forces><force id="7b1boxe" name="Auxillary Units" entryId="6084-3baa-f00b-ac0a::8732-47c4-9f1c-e71e" catalogueId="8e0e-5e8c-5824-89c9" catalogueRevision="36" catalogueName="Ossiarch Bonereapers"><selections><selection id="tpdvpqc" name="Arch-Kavalos Zandtos" entryId="f251-90be-5e0d-e76e::3d7d-bb9a-b450-8a47" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="d77a-ec8a-b36b-7ec4" name="Arch-Kavalos Zandtos" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">10&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">8</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="4ea8-2b5b-b380-9016" name="Unstoppable Charge" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle, Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit charged this turn, pick each enemy unit in combat with it to be the targets.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">The targets have **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="2d3e-4ac0-9ff1-99eb" name="Still Their Breath!" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly non-**^^Hero Ossiarch Bonereapers Cavalry^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Spend 1 **relentless discipline** point. If this unit is in combat, no **relentless discipline** points are spent. The target's melee weapons have **Charge (+1 Damage)** for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Relentless Discipline^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="tpym7lt" name="Arch-Kavalos Zandtos" entryId="f251-90be-5e0d-e76e::8749-fcae-2716-e2be" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="tqrkcs" name="Kavalos Steed's Hooves, Teeth, and Barbed Tails" entryId="f251-90be-5e0d-e76e::a015-ed50-95-dec6" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="7ed4-a09-11f8-f765" name="Kavalos Steed's Hooves, Teeth, and Barbed Tails" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="tqeiw" name="The Dark Lance" entryId="f251-90be-5e0d-e76e::131e-ca60-4ffc-142e" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="13c3-30bf-925b-be1a" name="The Dark Lance" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Charge (+1 Damage)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="220" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" name="DEATH" entryId="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" primary="false" /><category id="5603-d1-a021-331e" name="OSSIARCH BONEREAPERS" entryId="5603-d1-a021-331e" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="926c-df8c-6841-d49e" name="CAVALRY" entryId="926c-df8c-6841-d49e" primary="false" /><category id="0cf3-b75a-0999-7508" name="RELENTLESS DISCIPLINE (7)" entryId="0cf3-b75a-0999-7508" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="twl5qpi" name="Arkhan the Black, Mortarch of Sacrament" entryId="d622-6a8f-a4-9f14::6652-19e0-6044-62e8" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="bd06-92bc-281-37eb" name="Arkhan the Black, Mortarch of Sacrament" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">12&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">14</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">5</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="8134-17b4-5c5d-19c1" name="Battle Damaged" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of **Razarak's Ebon Claws** is 3.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Damage</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="5a58-d58d-c83a-6d2" name="The Staff of Spirits" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Add 1 to casting rolls for this unit. Each time this unit successfully casts a spell, **Heal (1)** this unit after that **^^Spell^^** ability has been resolved.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="5adc-d600-8746-1eab" name="The Doom of Traitors" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit charged this turn, pick an enemy unit in combat with it to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a D3. Add 1 to the roll if the target is a **^^Wizard^^** or **^^Priest^^**. On a 2+, add an amount equal to the roll to the Attacks characteristic of this unit's **Razarak's Ebon Claws** for the rest of the phase, but while this unit is in combat with the target, all attacks made with that weapon this phase must target that enemy unit.
**Designer's Note:** *If the target is a* **^^Wizard^^** *or* **^^Priest^^***, this ability cannot fail; however you still need to roll to determine the number of extra attacks it generates.*</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="95d2-fbf3-9754-a69e" name="Mortarch of Sacrament" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn, Reaction: Opponent declared a **^^Spell^^** ability for a unit within 18&quot; of this unit</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll 2D6. If the roll exceeds the casting roll for the spell, then the spell is unbound, its effect is not resolved and that **^^Spell^^** ability cannot be used by enemy units until the start of your next turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="4458-65e0-d01e-85ca" name="Curse of Years" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Roll 10 dice. For each 6:
• Give the target 1 **necrotic withering** point.
• Roll an extra dice.
For each 5+ on those extra dice, repeat the above bullet points. Then, do the same for each 4+, and then each 3+. Finally, for each 2+, give the target 1 **necrotic withering** point (do not roll any extra dice),
After a roll, if the target has 8 or more **necrotic withering points**, it is automatically destroyed. Otherwise, after the last roll, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the number of **necrotic withering** points it has. Then, those **necrotic withering** points are lost.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Offensive</attribute></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="8e01-c601-8a44-8f74" name="Fly" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">As this unit moves, it ignores other models, terrain features and the combat ranges of enemy units. It cannot end its move in combat unless specified in the ability that allowed it to move. Ignore any vertical distance moved for this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="twhvqen" name="Arkhan the Black, Mortarch of Sacrament" entryId="d622-6a8f-a4-9f14::3675-506e-fbe2-ddee" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="txb2lc" name="Razarak's Ebon Claws" entryId="d622-6a8f-a4-9f14::11b7-f632-e6d3-fcae" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="c6e6-2bec-bc83-cca6" name="Razarak's Ebon Claws" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="tx98d0nj" name="Zefet-kar and Khenash-an" entryId="d622-6a8f-a4-9f14::9795-3707-fdcc-cefc" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="8fe5-311c-8c4-385a" name="Zefet-kar and Khenash-an" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="440" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" name="DEATH" entryId="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" primary="false" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="5603-d1-a021-331e" name="OSSIARCH BONEREAPERS" entryId="5603-d1-a021-331e" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" name="FLY" entryId="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" primary="false" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" primary="false" /><category id="8bc-6d63-e37f-9239" name="WIZARD (3)" entryId="8bc-6d63-e37f-9239" primary="false" /><category id="c203-51a0-3d44-6b07" name="WARMASTER" entryId="c203-51a0-3d44-6b07" primary="false" /><category id="2fb7-c843-5c87-f039" name="RELENTLESS DISCIPLINE (3)" entryId="2fb7-c843-5c87-f039" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="u3exfv8" name="Katakros, Mortarch of the Necropolis" entryId="4587-ae29-90ef-4bbb::9294-b53c-e996-198c" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="a86c-5656-a4ee-fd7b" name="Battle Damaged" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the number after its **^^Relentless Discipline^^** keyword is 4.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Damage</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="71bd-c310-eaeb-e69f" name="Katakros, Mortarch of the Necropolis" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">4&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">20</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">10</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="e18c-9aa-ffab-b18e" name="Mortarch of the Necropolis" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Add 3 to the control scores of visible friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** units that have used any **^^Relentless Discipline^^** abilities this turn.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Control</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="cd33-c664-d0c4-9474" name="Aviarch Spymaster" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+, the target cannot use commands for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="46c1-766e-179b-3c1c" name="You Dare?!" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle, Start of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">This unit can only use this ability if at least half the units from your starting army have been destroyed.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the battle round:
• Add 5 to the Attacks characteristic of this unit's **Inda-Khaat**.
• Add 3 to the Attacks characteristic of this unit's **The Shield Immortis**.
• This unit cannot use the 'Supreme Lord of the Bonereaper Legions' ability.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ec-6c0b-673c-88ee" name="Supreme Lord of the Bonereaper Legions" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit is not in combat, pick a visible friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit that is in combat and has not used a **^^Relentless Discipline^^** ability this phase to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Spend a number of **relentless discipline** points equal to the target's Health characteristic. If the target is reinforced and has more than half of its starting models, spend an additional **relentless discipline** point. The target can use 2 **^^Fight^^** abilities this phase. After the first is used, however, the target has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn. In addition, the target cannot use **^^Relentless Discipline^^** abilities for the rest of the phase.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="u30nbazf" name="Katakros, Mortarch of the Necropolis" entryId="4587-ae29-90ef-4bbb::babf-adbe-1db7-f2ce" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="u4u5rb" name="Inda-Khaat" entryId="4587-ae29-90ef-4bbb::b65-db5b-f4f8-3d1a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="2853-ae1d-e386-8491" name="Inda-Khaat" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (2 Hits)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="u49wl3k" name="Retinue Blades" entryId="4587-ae29-90ef-4bbb::f883-6d8c-c9b5-a61d" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="81d1-aa4d-708e-a921" name="Retinue Blades" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">10</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="u4bzf7f" name="The Shield Immortis" entryId="4587-ae29-90ef-4bbb::f355-f5bd-5fab-3dda" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="e78a-b15-7a1a-5b26" name="The Shield Immortis" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="470" /></costs><categories><category id="5603-d1-a021-331e" name="OSSIARCH BONEREAPERS" entryId="5603-d1-a021-331e" primary="false" /><category id="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" name="DEATH" entryId="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="c203-51a0-3d44-6b07" name="WARMASTER" entryId="c203-51a0-3d44-6b07" primary="false" /><category id="3d40-cc89-c9ca-058a" name="RELENTLESS DISCIPLINE (10)" entryId="3d40-cc89-c9ca-058a" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="ubz9w3u" name="Liege-Kavalos" entryId="dbe5-2c39-2d83-5bde::94bd-295c-c868-27ee" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="68cd-d36c-8491-9cea" name="Liege-Kavalos" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">10&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="a56c-9780-a411-832b" name="Deathrider Commander" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">This unit and visible friendly **Kavalos Deathriders** units wholly within 12&quot; Of this unit can move 12&quot; instead of 10&quot; when they use the 'Deathrider Wedge' ability.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="52d7-781f-d8a2-5484" name="Master of Cavalry" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Reaction: You declared a **^^Fight^^** ability for this unit</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick a friendly **Kavalos Deathriders** unit that has not used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn and is within this unit's combat range to be the target. The target can be picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the ^^**Fight^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved. If it is picked to do so, add 1 to hit rolls for the target's combat attacks for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="ubt09r" name="Liege-Kavalos" entryId="dbe5-2c39-2d83-5bde::5ea0-176a-10e0-9742" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="ug4cnqj" name="Commander's Blade" entryId="dbe5-2c39-2d83-5bde::63d2-76f4-634e-fb74" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="5507-d580-4c2f-c8e4" name="Commander's Blade" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Charge (+1 Damage)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="ugvqq5t" name="Kavalos Steed's Hooves, Teeth, and Barbed Tails" entryId="dbe5-2c39-2d83-5bde::dc8f-4d76-7cd-27e1" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="dc06-cb0c-ee4d-717d" name="Kavalos Steed's Hooves, Teeth, and Barbed Tails" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="180" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" name="DEATH" entryId="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" primary="false" /><category id="5603-d1-a021-331e" name="OSSIARCH BONEREAPERS" entryId="5603-d1-a021-331e" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="926c-df8c-6841-d49e" name="CAVALRY" entryId="926c-df8c-6841-d49e" primary="false" /><category id="7f9b-0dda-ac91-6b5f" name="RELENTLESS DISCIPLINE (6)" entryId="7f9b-0dda-ac91-6b5f" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="uo9xgj" name="Liege-Kavalos on War Chariot" entryId="e6df-ec72-ecd3-2f9e::81d0-9a4a-fb83-8626" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="1fde-7c8d-15fd-356a" name="Liege-Kavalos on War Chariot" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">10&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">12</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="08a1-8cb5-c29b-9649" name="Grind Them to Dust" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Movement Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit is in combat, pick this unit and up to 2 visible friendly **Kavalos War Chariots** wholly within 12&quot; of this unit and in combat to be the targets.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For each target:
• Make a pile-in move.
• Then, pick an enemy unit in combat with the target and roll a D3. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on that enemy unit equal to the roll.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Grey</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="cc24-030b-2b17-3a36" name="Masterful Charioteer" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit is in combat and has charged this turn, pick this unit and up to 2 visible friendly **Kavalos War Chariots** that have charged this turn, that are wholly within 12&quot; Of this unit and that are in combat to be the targets.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Each target has **^^Ward (5+)^^** for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="uoi0hjh" name="Liege-Kavalos on War Chariot" entryId="e6df-ec72-ecd3-2f9e::03ae-6384-3f82-674b" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="utcarp" name="Commander's Blade" entryId="e6df-ec72-ecd3-2f9e::3904-8e12-bc78-cd5a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="b755-86d3-4787-7706" name="Commander's Blade" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Charge (+1 Damage)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="ut3d94q" name="Kavalos Steed's Hooves, Teeth, and Barbed Tails" entryId="e6df-ec72-ecd3-2f9e::7ea6-9134-8358-4e45" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="bc7f-5ee4-cb79-4f23" name="Kavalos Steed's Hooves, Teeth, and Barbed Tails" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="210" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" name="DEATH" entryId="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" primary="false" /><category id="5603-d1-a021-331e" name="OSSIARCH BONEREAPERS" entryId="5603-d1-a021-331e" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="7f9b-0dda-ac91-6b5f" name="RELENTLESS DISCIPLINE (6)" entryId="7f9b-0dda-ac91-6b5f" primary="false" /><category id="f7bc-b618-4b5d-2bae" name="WAR MACHINE" entryId="f7bc-b618-4b5d-2bae" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="v1zij6f" name="Liege-Mortek" entryId="55e5-ac0b-2832-64ef::bf96-2414-2772-b78a" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="9930-ee64-f280-d305" name="Liege-Mortek" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">5&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="ab0c-feeb-e5d4-0098" name="Clinical Efficiency" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase, Reaction: You declared a **^^Fight^^** ability for this unit</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick a visible friendly **Mortek Guard**, **Mortek Triaxes** or **Mortek Crawler** unit that has not used an **^^Attack^^** ability this phase and is wholly within 12&quot; Of this unit to be the target. Immediately after the **^^Fight^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved, the target can be picked to use either a **^^Shoot^^** ability as if it were your shooting phase or a **^^Fight^^** ability. If it is picked to do so:
• Add 1 to hit rolls for the target's attacks for the rest of the turn.
• The target's ranged weapons (if any) have **Shoot in Combat** for the rest of the turn.
• If the target uses a **^^Shoot^^** ability and is not in combat, all of its shooting attacks must target units in combat with this unit.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="v2xrnvl" name="Liege-Mortek" entryId="55e5-ac0b-2832-64ef::eda5-9c41-2681-28f0" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="vbpz2c6" name="Commander's Weapon" entryId="55e5-ac0b-2832-64ef::acf9-8bf6-46f2-bf7f" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="aa88-f60d-1759-a179" name="Commander's Weapon" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="120" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" name="DEATH" entryId="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" primary="false" /><category id="5603-d1-a021-331e" name="OSSIARCH BONEREAPERS" entryId="5603-d1-a021-331e" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="f77f-b20a-b844-dbc1" name="RELENTLESS DISCIPLINE (5)" entryId="f77f-b20a-b844-dbc1" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="vj11qrj" name="Mortisan Boneshaper" entryId="9dda-d17f-a89c-b0f3::13ec-ca46-9e71-ad2" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="a9b3-387-c66e-4e99" name="Mortisan Boneshaper" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">5&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="af43-b230-4236-2e73" name="Legion Quartermaster" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Each time a friendly non-**^^Hero Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit uses the 'Rally' command, you can make 3 additional rally rolls of D6.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Rallying</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="657a-b5cf-ce10-fcab" name="Boneshaper" hidden="false" typeId="55ac-f837-dded-5872" typeName="Ability (Command)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="736-6e3a-d0b5-a1b0">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Cost" typeId="a49e-3082-e2a6-e802">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="b77f-7548-840e-c086">If this unit is not in combat, pick a friendly **Mortek Guard**  or **Mortek Triaxes** unit that has been destroyed to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="2111-3ca8-61dd-a5f0">Set up a replacement unit with half the number of models from the target unit (rounding up) wholly within 12&quot; of this unit and not in combat.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="445d-f443-5448-e7ce"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5c69-e4b9-19bc-e801">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="2bd5-08f1-f3d1-86f7">Rallying</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="df75-e7dc-12b5-48a8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="vj1bjb" name="Mortisan Boneshaper" entryId="9dda-d17f-a89c-b0f3::69c9-a869-6234-27c6" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="vnzhewd" name="Ossified Talons" entryId="9dda-d17f-a89c-b0f3::3dd4-bd2e-77b8-58cd" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="e1d4-7ebb-74f4-5568" name="Ossified Talons" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="140" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" name="WIZARD (1)" entryId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="5603-d1-a021-331e" name="OSSIARCH BONEREAPERS" entryId="5603-d1-a021-331e" primary="false" /><category id="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" name="DEATH" entryId="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" primary="false" /><category id="4d3b-23e7-f8f0-9780" name="RELENTLESS DISCIPLINE (2)" entryId="4d3b-23e7-f8f0-9780" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="vvke636i" name="Mortisan Ossifector" entryId="a808-e9cc-f583-1bb8::93ac-6567-8147-a11" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="4613-e9f-e7c9-2242" name="Mortisan Ossifector" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">5&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="5fc8-2b4d-ab3b-f004" name="Refined Creations" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **Mortek Crawler**, **Gothizzar Harvester**, **Morghast Archai** or **Morghast Harbingers** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+, add 1 to the Rend characteristic of the target's weapons until the start of your next turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="8e01-c601-8a44-8f74" name="Fly" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">As this unit moves, it ignores other models, terrain features and the combat ranges of enemy units. It cannot end its move in combat unless specified in the ability that allowed it to move. Ignore any vertical distance moved for this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="vwsmnfq" name="Mortisan Ossifector" entryId="a808-e9cc-f583-1bb8::2ba4-ef95-e986-ad3a" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="w0u689t" name="Ossified Talons" entryId="a808-e9cc-f583-1bb8::c6fa-3afb-f230-d7a3" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="7e1-3da4-ff34-98a4" name="Ossified Talons" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="110" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" name="WIZARD (1)" entryId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="5603-d1-a021-331e" name="OSSIARCH BONEREAPERS" entryId="5603-d1-a021-331e" primary="false" /><category id="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" name="DEATH" entryId="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" primary="false" /><category id="4d3b-23e7-f8f0-9780" name="RELENTLESS DISCIPLINE (2)" entryId="4d3b-23e7-f8f0-9780" primary="false" /><category id="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" name="FLY" entryId="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="w87dj4l" name="Mortisan Soulmason" entryId="3365-1f2b-1cb2-8795::49c5-563d-d7b-6d61" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="2d2c-92f-41ac-e949" name="Mortisan Soulmason" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">6&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="a784-f4a8-e10d-9b91" name="Soul-guide" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a visible friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of the caster to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">The target has **^^Strike-first^^** for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Offensive</attribute></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="w9gb2l" name="Mortisan Soulmason" entryId="3365-1f2b-1cb2-8795::b4c7-762b-16aa-d9a2" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="wdlprs5" name="Soulmason's Staff" entryId="3365-1f2b-1cb2-8795::64ee-4cf9-d79c-ad6f" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="e8b1-18ef-3f3-75c3" name="Soulmason's Staff" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="140" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="5603-d1-a021-331e" name="OSSIARCH BONEREAPERS" entryId="5603-d1-a021-331e" primary="false" /><category id="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" name="DEATH" entryId="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" primary="false" /><category id="8179-697a-9f4c-91d4" name="WIZARD (2)" entryId="8179-697a-9f4c-91d4" primary="false" /><category id="4d3b-23e7-f8f0-9780" name="RELENTLESS DISCIPLINE (2)" entryId="4d3b-23e7-f8f0-9780" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="wl9lovc" name="Mortisan Soulreaper" entryId="7d72-d40d-1de4-8de1::647a-dcd6-b2d8-642b" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="1626-47a1-da74-17ea" name="Mortisan Soulreaper" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">5&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="ca93-de84-1e69-b8c6" name="Soulreaper" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Subtract 1 from wound rolls for combat attacks made by enemy units while they are in combat with this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Green</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="846c-e117-b178-2ddf" name="Necrotic Impetus" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick each enemy unit in combat with this unit to be the targets.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a D3 for each target. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll. After this ability has been resolved, you gain a number of **relentless discipline** points equal to the number of total damage points allocated by this ability this turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="8e01-c601-8a44-8f74" name="Fly" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">As this unit moves, it ignores other models, terrain features and the combat ranges of enemy units. It cannot end its move in combat unless specified in the ability that allowed it to move. Ignore any vertical distance moved for this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="wmuucw" name="Mortisan Soulreaper" entryId="7d72-d40d-1de4-8de1::8eb4-2dde-49dd-176c" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="wqubj09" name="Soulreaper Scythe" entryId="7d72-d40d-1de4-8de1::6f42-6c0-5a4a-79" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="aa3d-6ed7-ebc1-4fcc" name="Soulreaper Scythe" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (2 Hits)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="120" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" name="WIZARD (1)" entryId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="5603-d1-a021-331e" name="OSSIARCH BONEREAPERS" entryId="5603-d1-a021-331e" primary="false" /><category id="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" name="DEATH" entryId="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" primary="false" /><category id="4d3b-23e7-f8f0-9780" name="RELENTLESS DISCIPLINE (2)" entryId="4d3b-23e7-f8f0-9780" primary="false" /><category id="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" name="FLY" entryId="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="x6e8o0s" name="Nagash, Supreme Lord of the Undead" entryId="c3eb-a11c-f7fa-2cfb::aeef-a74c-9eec-5169" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="216a-5bdd-cd9e-d622" name="Nagash, Supreme Lord of the Undead" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">10&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">18</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">10</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="c8a6-f264-cdcf-c43b" name="Battle Damaged" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, subtract 3 from its power level.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Damage</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="c01f-c73d-2c3f-c3b2" name="The Staff of Power" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Add 2 to casting rolls for this unit while it has not miscast any spells this turn. If this unit miscasts a spell, ignore the restriction that would stop this unit from casting any more spells this turn.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="9588-3497-f6b-76f5" name="Hand of Dust" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), End of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible enemy **^^Hero^^** or **^^Monster^^** in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Hide a dice in one of your hands or under one of two appropriate containers. Your opponent must pick one of your hands or containers. If they pick the one hiding the dice, this ability has no effect. If they pick the empty one, the target is automatically destroyed.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="df62-4957-56b6-b22c" name="Supreme Lord of the Undead" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle, Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly non-**^^Hero^^** non-**^^Unique Death^^** unit that has been destroyed to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Set up a replacement unit identical to the target wholly within 12&quot; of this unit and more than 9&quot; from all enemy units.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Rallying</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="623b-9e30-bc60-c984" name="Invocation of Nagash" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">This unit can cast this spell more than once per phase. Pick a visible unit wholly within 18&quot; of this unit that has not been picked to be the target of this spell this turn to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">If the target is an enemy unit, inflict D3 mortal damage on it. If the target is a friendly **^^Death^^** unit, pick 1 of the following effects:
• Return a number of slain models to the target unit with a combined Health characteristic of up to 3.
• The target has **^^Ward (5+)^^** until the start of your next turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Special</attribute></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="8e01-c601-8a44-8f74" name="Fly" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">As this unit moves, it ignores other models, terrain features and the combat ranges of enemy units. It cannot end its move in combat unless specified in the ability that allowed it to move. Ignore any vertical distance moved for this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="x6ut2zd" name="Nagash, Supreme Lord of the Undead" entryId="c3eb-a11c-f7fa-2cfb::6f9c-3bc1-f1c5-d944" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="x7tgxa" name="Alakanash, the Staff of Power" entryId="c3eb-a11c-f7fa-2cfb::6e8a-c4ed-ea50-6798" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="c355-57a5-c3de-21e7" name="Alakanash, the Staff of Power" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D6</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="x7howva" name="Zefet-nebtar, the Mortis Blade" entryId="c3eb-a11c-f7fa-2cfb::8947-aa02-dba0-ac55" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="43ef-e3ca-3476-6746" name="Zefet-nebtar, the Mortis Blade" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="830" /></costs><categories><category id="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" name="DEATH" entryId="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" primary="false" /><category id="5603-d1-a021-331e" name="OSSIARCH BONEREAPERS" entryId="5603-d1-a021-331e" primary="false" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" primary="false" /><category id="5a9b-95b7-c807-341f" name="WIZARD (9)" entryId="5a9b-95b7-c807-341f" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /><category id="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" name="FLY" entryId="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" primary="false" /><category id="c203-51a0-3d44-6b07" name="WARMASTER" entryId="c203-51a0-3d44-6b07" primary="false" /><category id="2fb7-c843-5c87-f039" name="RELENTLESS DISCIPLINE (3)" entryId="2fb7-c843-5c87-f039" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="xhzmn6g" name="Vokmortian, Master of the Bone-tithe" entryId="b55b-62e8-e8fe-88c7::f92d-b53f-1f6f-1646" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="4541-c949-50ee-b5b3" name="Vokmortian, Master of the Bone-tithe" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">5&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="33cf-317d-ea75-d3ff" name="Voice of Nagash" hidden="false" typeId="55ac-f837-dded-5872" typeName="Ability (Command)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="736-6e3a-d0b5-a1b0">Enemy Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Cost" typeId="a49e-3082-e2a6-e802">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="b77f-7548-840e-c086">Pick a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="2111-3ca8-61dd-a5f0">The target cannot be picked to be the target of or be affected by any non-**^^Core^^** abilities used by other enemy units for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="445d-f443-5448-e7ce"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5c69-e4b9-19bc-e801">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="2bd5-08f1-f3d1-86f7">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="df75-e7dc-12b5-48a8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="200c-c7f0-9ef9-1c2d" name="Mortal Contract" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn, each time the target is picked to use a **^^Core^^** ability, roll a D3. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll. If the target is destroyed by this ability, do not resolve the effect of that **^^Core^^** ability.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Offensive</attribute></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="xhnht7" name="Vokmortian, Master of the Bone-tithe" entryId="b55b-62e8-e8fe-88c7::1804-acc4-77e-7e55" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="ximniim" name="Gaze of Death" entryId="b55b-62e8-e8fe-88c7::5902-cdb8-7729-3199" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="cc4b-f06a-2635-2fa" name="Gaze of Death" hidden="false" typeId="1fd-a42f-41d3-fe05" typeName="Ranged Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Rng" typeId="c6b5-908c-a604-1a98">12&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="aa17-4296-2887-e05d">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="194d-aeb6-5ba7-83b4">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="d3d5-9dc6-13de-8d1">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="d03f-a9ae-3eec-755">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="96c2-d0a5-ea1e-653b">D6</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="d793-3dd7-9c13-741e">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="xidqcf6" name="Staff of Retribution" entryId="b55b-62e8-e8fe-88c7::dabd-2661-76ab-ea95" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="cc35-5f1d-9f86-2676" name="Staff of Retribution" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="140" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="8179-697a-9f4c-91d4" name="WIZARD (2)" entryId="8179-697a-9f4c-91d4" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" name="DEATH" entryId="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" primary="false" /><category id="5603-d1-a021-331e" name="OSSIARCH BONEREAPERS" entryId="5603-d1-a021-331e" primary="false" /><category id="4d3b-23e7-f8f0-9780" name="RELENTLESS DISCIPLINE (2)" entryId="4d3b-23e7-f8f0-9780" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="xqov7j" name="Vokmortian, Master of the Bone-tithe (Scourge of Aqshy)" entryId="a5ed-63c2-c475-a876::c34a-0e3a-2be4-21b3" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="8951-b9bb-0b05-6e03" name="Vokmortian, Master of the Bone-tithe" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">5&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="9f67-6f36-a3d8-4eaa" name="Master of the Bone-Tithe" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Your opponent must pick 1 of the following effects:
**Pay the Tithe:** Your opponent must pick a unit in their army on the battlefield to be the target. They cannot pick a **^^Manifestation^^** or terrain feature. Then:
• Inflict D6 mortal damage on the target.
• Until the start of your next turn, the target cannot be healed, have slain models returned to it or be replaced.
**Deny the Ossiarchs their Rightful Due:** Pick 1 of the following effects:
• You gain 4 **relentless discipline** points.
• Pick an objective you do not control. For the rest of the turn, add 5 to the control scores of friendly **^^Ossiarch Bonereapers^^** units while they are contesting that objective.
• For the rest of the turn, add 2 to the Attacks characteristic and add 6&quot; to the Range characteristic of this unit's **Gaze of Death**.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="82a5-bf48-027b-880e" name="Cowed into Inaction" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a visible enemy **^^Hero^^** within 18&quot; of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn, each time an enemy unit within the target's combat range uses a command, unless your opponent spends 1 **rage dice** to use that command, the command has no effect, it still counts as having been used and the command points spent to use it are lost.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Special</attribute></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="xqxutnd" name="Vokmortian, Master of the Bone-tithe" entryId="a5ed-63c2-c475-a876::b692-f0ef-e24c-cbeb" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="xs8b5b" name="Gaze of Death" entryId="a5ed-63c2-c475-a876::214d-27d1-939f-051e" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="9022-ec9e-75d4-6360" name="Gaze of Death" hidden="false" typeId="1fd-a42f-41d3-fe05" typeName="Ranged Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Rng" typeId="c6b5-908c-a604-1a98">12&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="aa17-4296-2887-e05d">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="194d-aeb6-5ba7-83b4">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="d3d5-9dc6-13de-8d1">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="d03f-a9ae-3eec-755">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="96c2-d0a5-ea1e-653b">D6</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="d793-3dd7-9c13-741e">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="xs7xftb" name="Staff of Retribution" entryId="a5ed-63c2-c475-a876::78db-7206-6f55-c6e5" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="e1f9-35c9-68ea-9732" name="Staff of Retribution" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="180" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="8179-697a-9f4c-91d4" name="WIZARD (2)" entryId="8179-697a-9f4c-91d4" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" name="DEATH" entryId="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" primary="false" /><category id="5603-d1-a021-331e" name="OSSIARCH BONEREAPERS" entryId="5603-d1-a021-331e" primary="false" /><category id="4d3b-23e7-f8f0-9780" name="RELENTLESS DISCIPLINE (2)" entryId="4d3b-23e7-f8f0-9780" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="xz1weqr" name="Immortis Guard" entryId="537d-263-412a-f179::c1b9-f148-7fe4-8660" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="22dc-c31a-5335-d05d" name="Immortis Guard" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">5&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">1</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="2c86-163e-bc0e-cd8" name="Immortal Bulwark" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit in combat with this unit and that charged this turn to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Other than the **Companion** weapon ability, weapon abilities for the target's combat attacks have no effect for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="y1g3jah3" name="Immortis Guard" entryId="537d-263-412a-f179::a45f-5d0e-72fd-af7b" number="3" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="y1wlzy5" name="Dread Halberd" entryId="537d-263-412a-f179::5de6-5752-10a7-f4a5" number="3" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="5882-5afd-fe5-e3e" name="Dread Halberd" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="170" /></costs><categories><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" primary="true" /><category id="5603-d1-a021-331e" name="OSSIARCH BONEREAPERS" entryId="5603-d1-a021-331e" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" name="DEATH" entryId="d484-a2d7-cf4f-c4a0" primary="false"